    "Command-1 to 4 choose the view and the wireframe. Command-0 zooms to fit. Command-plus and Command-minus zoom.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Shared app and Quick Look UI. Preserve format names, keyboard shortcuts and %@ placeholders.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1 to 4 choose the view and the wireframe. Command-0 zooms to fit. Command-plus and Command-minus zoom."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1 至 4 选择视图和线框。Command-0 缩放以适应窗口。Command-加号和 Command-减号调整缩放。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comando-1 a 4 eligen la vista y la malla de alambre. Comando-0 ajusta a la ventana. Comando-más y Comando-menos cambian el zoom."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commande-1 à 4 choisissent la vue et le fil de fer. Commande-0 ajuste à la fenêtre. Commande-plus et Commande-moins modifient le zoom."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Befehl-1 bis 4 wählen Ansicht und Drahtgitter. Befehl-0 passt an das Fenster an. Befehl-Plus und Befehl-Minus zoomen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1〜4で表示とワイヤーフレームを選択します。Command-0でウインドウに合わせます。Command-プラスとCommand-マイナスでズームします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1 a 4 escolhem a vista e o aramado. Command-0 ajusta à janela. Command-mais e Command-menos alteram o zoom."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1~4로 보기와 와이어프레임을 선택합니다. Command-0은 창에 맞춥니다. Command-더하기 및 Command-빼기로 확대하거나 축소합니다."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comando-1 a 4 scelgono la vista e il reticolo. Comando-0 adatta alla finestra. Comando-più e Comando-meno modificano lo zoom."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Command-1–4 выбирают вид и каркас. Command-0 вписывает модель в окно. Command-плюс и Command-минус меняют масштаб."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
