    "Open OBJ, STL, PLY, 3MF, USD, USDA, USDC, USDZ, 3DS, glTF, GLB, FBX, Blender, VRM and VRMA files with File > Open… or Finder's Open With > Spacebar 3D.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
